Troy Goode and Douglas Christopher Wilson own most of the surviving code. Troy Goode owns about 41% of lines and Douglas Christopher Wilson about 32%.

The `git-historian` ownership numbers are misleading. They say "Fiona Formatter" owns 51% of lines, but that is only the `62628c0` commit that reformatted the whole JS codebase to 4-space indent and double quotes. That commit did not write the logic. I re-ran `git blame` with `--ignore-revs-file .git-blame-ignore-revs -w -M -C` to skip it. The counts below come from that run and cover all tracked text files.

| Author | Surviving lines | Share (approx.) |
