| Douglas Christopher Wilson | 629 | 32% |
| Íñigo Marquínez Prado | 95 | 5% |
| Jon Church | 72 | 4% |
| Sebastian Beltran | 67 | 3% |
| Ulises Gascón | 52 | 3% |
| Ignacio Mangas | 44 | 2% |
| Alejandro Caravaca Puchades | 30 | 1.5% |
| Linus Unnebäck | 26 | 1.3% |

About 10 more authors own 6–17 lines each. I cut the list at 20 authors, so the shares are a few percent off.

- **Troy Goode:** Owns most of `lib/index.js` and the tests. `test/vary.js` is 100% his and `test/issue-2.js` is 83%.
- **Douglas Christopher Wilson:** Owns the project scaffolding: `.eslintrc.yml`, `package.json`, `LICENSE`, `HISTORY.md` and about half of `ci.yml`.
- **Íñigo Marquínez Prado, Sebastian Beltran and Ulises Gascón:** Own the `.github/` workflow files, which are mostly CI, scorecard, CodeQL and dependabot config.
- **Jon Church and Linus Unnebäck:** Own most of the remaining `README.md` lines.

The tool also flags every file as orphaned, meaning the main owner has no commits since 2026-04-22. That check uses the reformat commit as an owner, so it is distorted too. The real concentration risk is Troy Goode and Douglas Christopher Wilson, who together own about 73% of the lines.

